This project is derived from, and builds on, work by Reis Can (reisxd):
  - TizenBrewInstaller  https://github.com/reisxd/TizenBrewInstaller  (GPL-3.0)
      on-TV installation via the TV's own sdbd and vd_appinstall
  - TizenTube           https://github.com/reisxd/TizenTube           (GPL-3.0)
      DevTools-based userscript injection (planned for apps/ytmod)
  - tizen.js            https://github.com/reisxd/tizen.js            (GPL-3.0)
      package signing (used as an optional build-time dependency)

The SDB packet format follows the public Android Debug Bridge protocol.
